THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------
This build includes third-party libraries (SDL3, zlib, libADLMIDI).
Their individual licenses are included inside the app bundle at:

    Pizza Legacy.app/Contents/Resources/LICENSES/

Right-click the app and choose "Show Package Contents" to browse it.

A summary of all third-party components can be found in `THIRD_PARTIES.txt`.

